{
  "id": 2489766,
  "name": "LTX-2.3-fight",
  "description": "<p>V3.0版本：本次更新主要针对动作和视角进行了初步补强，希望能为大家提供更多选择。</p><ul><li><p><strong>动作与视角</strong>：补充了部分战斗招式，稍微拓展了多角度的视觉呈现。</p></li><li><p><strong>数据集扩充</strong>：数据集增至 <strong>241 帧</strong>，尝试提升动态画面的连贯性。</p></li><li><p><strong>无需触发词</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>提示词</strong>：描述角色特征并搭配具体动作与环境描写，适当增加音效描写或者使用Lora加载节点屏蔽Lora的audio强度。</p></li><li><p><strong>Lora Strength</strong>：1.0</p></li><li><p><strong>frame rate</strong>：30~50 fps</p></li></ul><p>模型仍有诸多不足，欢迎大家尝试并多提宝贵意见。</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(130, 201, 30)\"><strong>Prompt 1:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">[Character A] and [Character B] are engaged in an intense [fighting/action style] duel in [scene]. [Detailed description of Character A, including clothing style, colors, and intricate details], [Detailed description of Character B, including clothing style, colors, and intricate details]. Their movements are [action rhythm description], unleashing a rapid and fierce exchange of blows. [Core Action 1], [Core Action 2], [Core Action 3], and [Core Action 4]...</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">Cinematic [shooting angles and camera movement style], with [visual elements of the background environment, key props, weather/lighting effects, and overall color tone]. [Core artistic style and aesthetic atmosphere].</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(130, 201, 30)\"><strong>Prompt 2:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">[Video Style], [Aspect Ratio], [Time of Day], [Location/Environment].<br />The entire scene is filled with [Lighting Atmosphere], [Environmental Details], [Air/Particle Effects], and [Overall Color Tone].</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">The left-side fighter wears [Left Character Outfit Description] with “[Left Character Name/Logo]” printed on the clothing. Their appearance features [Left Character Appearance], standing in [Left Character Fighting Stance].<br />The right-side fighter wears [Right Character Outfit Description] with “[Right Character Name/Logo]” printed on the clothing. Their appearance features [Right Character Appearance], standing in [Right Character Fighting Stance].<br />Both fighters face each other at [Core Scene Position], creating a feeling of [Scene Tension / Emotional Atmosphere].</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">【Opening Shot】<br />The camera begins from [Opening Camera Angle], slowly revealing [Environment Details].<br />The camera then [Camera Movement] toward the center between both fighters.<br />Cut to close-up shots of [Character Detail], [Clothing Detail], [Body Movement Detail], and [Environmental Reactions].<br />In the background, [Background Elements] can be seen clearly.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">【Camera Cuts】<br />Extreme close-up of [Left Character Facial Detail / Expression].<br />Cut to [Right Character Facial Detail / Expression].<br />Rapid editing showcases [Pre-Fight Movement Details].<br />The camera suddenly [Dynamic Camera Motion] to transition into combat.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">【Fight Choreography】<br />[Left Character Name/Logo] launches the first attack with [Attack Move 1].<br />[Right Character Name/Logo] performs [Defensive Move] before countering with [Counterattack Move].<br />The fighters continuously exchange [Combat Style / Fighting Techniques].<br />Add [Impact Effects / Visual Effects].<br />Combat actions include: [Move 1], [Move 2], [Move 3], [Move 4].<br />Elements in the environment such as [Environmental Objects] react dynamically to the battle.</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">【Cinematography &amp; Camera Movement】<br />Use [Camera Style 1], [Camera Style 2], and [Camera Style 3].<br />Add [Visual Effect] during attack impacts.<br />The camera circles around the fighters with [Camera Rotation Description].<br />On impact moments, switch to [Slow Motion / Speed Ramp Effect].<br />Overall editing rhythm should feel [Editing Pace / Energy Level].</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(253, 126, 20)\">【Ending Shot】<br />Both fighters [Ending Character Action].<br />The camera [Ending Camera Movement].<br />The final frame includes [Final Scene Elements].<br />Freeze frame on [Final Pose / Final Composition].<br />The overall visual style should feel [Final Visual Style], with [Image Quality Description], [Lighting Quality], and [Motion Fluidity Description].</span></p>",
